# A click in the notebook's text puts the caret there (step
# local-tui-click-caret): tap the "6 7 * dup . 1+" line, F6 runs it.
# The text starts in column 2, row 3 of the 80x24 screen; the line is
# row 5.  A tap past the end of a line puts the caret at its end.
screen
tap 6 5
key K_F6
screen
tap 70 4
key K_F6
screen
click 6
